PaOS source licensing

* PaOS-owned core (boot chain, Boot Manager, kernel, drivers and hypervisor):
  Mozilla Public License 2.0. Full text: LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt.
* App interfaces, SDK, verb registry definitions and Forge tools:
  Apache License 2.0. Full text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
* Third-party code, data, fonts, libraries, firmware and guest components:
  their own licenses and notices. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES/.
* Separate apps, drivers, recipes and bundles by other authors: the author's
  choice, subject to the terms of material they actually incorporate.

This applies only to material the project has authority to license. It does
not relicense third-party material. Existing copyright and permission notices
remain in force, and a license notice or SPDX identifier in a file governs that
file. The file-by-file license map is still being completed for the first
release.

Contributions, when they open, use Developer Certificate of Origin sign-off,
with no CLA and no copyright assignment. See CONTRIBUTING.md. These licenses
grant no trademark rights.
